      "created_at": "2014-07-31T21:28:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just to make sure I know what we're looking at, those 3D environments are what will be on the screen behind the cards we're playing with, correct?&nbsp; We're not saying that Wraith and Legacy and Ra are going to be running around down there under the trees with the dinos, right?</p>",
